Originally, a Zenith Z-100 MS-DOS machine, which ran at the same speed 
as an original IBM-PC.  I then got an enhanced chip that ran something 
like 20% faster.  A couple months later, my wife got a new MS-DOS box 
that was twice as fast as an IBM PC, and we were using both machines to 
do runs, close to 24/7.  It still took months.

